==============================================================================
TILESET PALETTE ARRAY BOUNDS
repo root: /private/tmp/pkmn-world-bw-336
==============================================================================

--- Derived constants (read from the tree, not assumed) ---
  NUM_PALS_IN_PRIMARY       : 6 (Emerald layouts)        include/fieldmap.h
  NUM_PALS_IN_PRIMARY_FRLG  : 7 (FRLG + Johto layouts)   include/fieldmap.h
  NUM_PALS_TOTAL            : 13                          include/fieldmap.h
  PALETTES_MAP              : 0x00001FFF                include/palette.h
  alt-palette index         : (i + 9) % 16               src/overworld.c UpdateAltBgPalettes
  blend mask after ^(1<<0)  : 0x00001FFE -> palettes 1..12 may blend
  primary-count selection   : GetNumPalsInPrimary() = (isFrlg || isJohto) ? 7 : 6
  layout_version -> regime  : frlg/johto = FRLG regime, everything else = Emerald (tools/mapjson/mapjson.cpp)

--- Bounds these imply ---
  primary      : >= 7 rows -- the loader reads 0..6. Held at the FRLG/Johto
                 count for EVERY primary, because pairing one into a Johto
                 layout is a one-line layouts.json edit and that edit must
                 not be able to create a silent overread.
  secondary    : >= 13 rows -- the loader reads 6..12 (Emerald) or 7..12
                 (FRLG/Johto). The START moves with the regime, the END does
                 not, so 13 is the flat bound. NOT 16, and not row 15.
  swapPalettes : whatever (i + 9) % 16 reaches for the bits actually set,
                 up to all 16 rows. 0 tileset(s) set it today.

